From: girardijp3 <joao.girardi@fablabjoinville.com.br>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:25:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] eval_g1: waist yaw joint, background re-planning, current
 image client

- a policy with one more state/action value than arms + hands drives the waist yaw (last value)
- --replan=async (default): the next action chunk is computed in a worker thread while the current
  one plays, so the 30 Hz loop does not stop for inference; --replan=chunk is the old behaviour
- use the image client API that make_robot.py already has (image_host, camera config)
- --ee=none for arms only, --sim, --root, --threads; one-lens head camera; cam_head rename

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
